<title>USA: Dodge City feeder cattle prices mixed - USDA.</title>
<headline>Dodge City feeder cattle prices mixed - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers 300-650 lbs not enough for Medium and Large 1 for a market test, few sales steady to firm. Feeder steers 650-1000 lbs $2.00-3.00 lower. Feeder heifers 650-900 lbs $1.00-2.00 lower, USDA said.</p>
<p>Trade moderate, demand good. Receipts 86 percent 600 lbs and over; 09 percent 600 lbs and under; 05 percent cows and bulls with 250 early.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers (Figures in parentheses are weighted average prices) Medium and Large 1 200-250 lbs 112.00-116.00 (115.15); 8 head 255 lbs 110.00; 350-400 lbs 104.00-109.00 (108.04); 450-500 lbs 101.00-105.00 (102.54); 14 head 549 lbs 91.50; 4 head 596 lbs 87.50; 600-650 lbs 85.00- 89.50 (87.68); 650-700 lbs 83.00-85.00 (84.19); 700-750 lbs 80.25-84.10 (82.37); 750-800 lbs 79.50-83.25 (81.29); 800-850 lbs 78.00-82.85 (80.11); 850-900 lbs 77.10-81.60 (78.39); 900-950 lbs 77.50-78.10 (77.75); 950-1000 lbs 73.50-76.85 (74.78). Full and/or fleshy 34 head 794 lbs 78.60. Medium and Large 1-2 250-300 lbs 94.00-95.00 (94.80); 7 head 353 lbs 97.00; 400-450 lbs 90.00-96.00 (93.40); 450-500 lbs 89.00-97.50 (92.56); 500-550 lbs 84.00-89.00 (86.10); 10 head 736 lbs 78.50; 750-800 lbs 75.00-78.75 (75.55); 800-850 lbs 75.35-76.50 (75.48); 850-900 lbs 75.00-76.25 (75.75); 59 head 903 lbs 75.50; 950-1000 lbs 73.60-75.25 (74.60). Large 1 17 head 499 lbs 90.00. Medium 1-2 13 head 404 lbs 88.00; Medium 2-3 34 head 612 lbs 58.50; 8 head 825 lbs 54.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers Medium and Large 1 200-250 lbs 90.00-104.00 (101.11); 9 head 286 lbs 92.00; 11 head 371 lbs 92.50; 400-450 lbs 85.00-90.00 (87.33); 450-500 lbs 85.50- 87.00 (86.16); 8 head 549 lbs 83.50; 12 head 567 lbs 85.00; 47 head 622 lbs 82.00; 650-700 lbs 79.00-83.00 (80.41); 700-750 lbs 78.10-81.50 (79.95); 750-800 lbs 76.00-79.75 (78.15); 800-850 lbs 75.00-77.10 (76.79); 850-900 lbs 72.00-74.00 (73.42). Full and/or fleshy 11 head 691 lbs 76.75; 700-750 lbs 74.25-75.00 (74.83); 82 head 793 lbs 74.00. Medium and Large 1-2 350-400 lbs 75.00-83.00 (77.65); 400-450 lbs 81.00- 85.00 (81.93); 450-500 lbs 80.00-85.00 (83.18); 500-550 lbs 79.25-81.50 (80.00); 550-600 lbs 78.00-82.50 (81.39); 600-650 lbs 76.50-80.00 (79.09); 650-700 lbs 75.50-78.00 (77.07); 700-750 lbs 77.00-77.25 (77.08); 18 head 780 lbs 72.50; 14 head 810 lbs 74.50; 16 head 857 lbs 71.25. Medium 1 10 head 608 lbs 78.25. Baby Calves (per head,mixed steers,bulls and heifers) 110.00-235.00 (161.07); new borns 80.00-100.00 (90.00); 7 head Holsteins new borns 30.00. Feeding heiferettes and cows 50.00-68.00 (59.72).</p>
<p>((-Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
